1
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:59,000
"The Last Oath"

2
00:00:59,600 --> 00:01:04,100
(Episode 6: Infected Zone Map)

3
00:04:48,916 --> 00:04:50,000
Where am I?

4
00:04:54,666 --> 00:04:55,666
I'm alright.

5
00:04:58,541 --> 00:04:59,541
A-Leh.

6
00:05:27,500 --> 00:05:28,500
Recovered yet?

7
00:05:28,958 --> 00:05:30,238
Back to causing trouble already.

8
00:05:31,541 --> 00:05:33,250
I just wanted to get some water.

9
00:05:50,833 --> 00:05:51,833
Lin Zai.

10
00:05:51,916 --> 00:05:53,750
Don't you know what you're allergic to?

11
00:05:55,375 --> 00:05:57,655
How was I supposed to know
I'd be allergic to that fruit?

12
00:05:57,750 --> 00:05:59,750
Besides, I didn't want
to suffer like this either!

13
00:06:02,666 --> 00:06:03,707
Because of you,

14
00:06:03,708 --> 00:06:05,750
we've already wasted a lot of time.

15
00:06:06,500 --> 00:06:08,208
If you keep fighting me on this,

16
00:06:08,666 --> 00:06:11,416
I guarantee you'll be
the one paying the price.

17
00:06:12,916 --> 00:06:14,916
So now you think I'm a burden, huh?

18
00:06:15,333 --> 00:06:17,165
If you hadn't dragged me out here,
none of this would've happened!

19
00:06:17,166 --> 00:06:18,166
Lin Zai.

20
00:06:19,666 --> 00:06:21,583
My only job is to keep you alive.

21
00:06:24,375 --> 00:06:26,708
Don't force me to use
the same methods on you

22
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:29,208
that I use on everyone else.

23
00:09:05,416 --> 00:09:06,749
It's not safe here.

24
00:09:06,750 --> 00:09:07,958
We need to leave now.

25
00:09:17,458 --> 00:09:18,916
That's a mutated zombie, right?

26
00:09:19,458 --> 00:09:22,041
It's huge. If we run into it,
not even God can save us.

27
00:09:22,791 --> 00:09:24,750
That's right. It's a Class A zombie.

28
00:09:25,041 --> 00:09:26,416
Normal weapons won't kill them.

29
00:09:36,541 --> 00:09:37,541
Fine, tie me up,

30
00:09:37,625 --> 00:09:38,625
but what's this for?

31
00:09:39,041 --> 00:09:41,333
To stop you from eating
things you shouldn't.

32
00:09:41,958 --> 00:09:43,540
I promise I won't do it again!

33
00:09:43,541 --> 00:09:45,781
And it's not like I got an
allergic reaction on purpose!

34
00:09:47,416 --> 00:09:49,176
Tying me up like this
really hurts my hands!

35
00:09:52,083 --> 00:09:53,083
Hey!

36
00:09:53,791 --> 00:09:55,267
You're just doing this to
get back at me, aren't you?

37
00:09:55,291 --> 00:09:56,958
You think this will make me behave?

38
00:09:58,541 --> 00:09:59,541
Just you wait!

39
00:10:18,750 --> 00:10:19,791
What now?

40
00:10:24,916 --> 00:10:25,916
What are you doing?

41
00:11:27,916 --> 00:11:29,581
You won't eat the crackers,
and you won't eat the meat.

42
00:11:32,125 --> 00:11:34,041
I'd rather die than eat your food!

43
00:11:35,708 --> 00:11:36,708
Lin Zai.

44
00:11:37,125 --> 00:11:39,125
Did my words just go in
one ear and out the other?

45
00:11:53,125 --> 00:11:54,125
Let go.

46
00:11:56,083 --> 00:11:57,963
Do you really love acting
like a dog that much?

47
00:12:05,958 --> 00:12:08,250
Taming a dog that bites is simple.

48
00:12:11,416 --> 00:12:13,833
You just have to pull out its fangs.

49
00:12:19,500 --> 00:12:20,500
Lin Zai.

50
00:12:21,250 --> 00:12:22,708
I'll say this one last time.

51
00:12:24,083 --> 00:12:26,083
Eat your food.

52
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:35,440
This is the last time I indulge you.

53
00:12:35,791 --> 00:12:36,875
Like I said before,

54
00:12:37,333 --> 00:12:39,500
my only job is to bring you back alive.

55
00:12:42,791 --> 00:12:44,250
If you refuse to eat,

56
00:12:45,333 --> 00:12:48,708
I'll make you eat my way.

57
00:13:32,375 --> 00:13:34,375
Are you planning to sit there all night?

58
00:14:30,708 --> 00:14:31,708
It's freezing.

59
00:14:32,291 --> 00:14:33,583
Why is it so drafty in here?

60
00:17:07,208 --> 00:17:08,375
You're not tying me up?

61
00:17:10,208 --> 00:17:12,500
There's no need. You can't run away anyway.

62
00:17:30,333 --> 00:17:31,333
Hey.

63
00:17:31,666 --> 00:17:33,040
After you take me back,

64
00:17:33,041 --> 00:17:34,041
then what?

65
00:17:34,250 --> 00:17:35,410
What's going to happen to me?

66
00:17:36,041 --> 00:17:37,500
And what do you get out of it?

67
00:17:38,791 --> 00:17:40,551
Don't ask questions
you shouldn't be asking.

68
00:17:40,958 --> 00:17:42,041
Will I die?

69
00:17:43,125 --> 00:17:45,485
You're the first immune carrier
our organization has found.

70
00:17:47,291 --> 00:17:48,666
What are they going to do to me?

71
00:17:49,250 --> 00:17:51,541
They're not going to dissect me, are they?

72
00:17:53,291 --> 00:17:54,958
That's above my pay grade.

73
00:17:58,208 --> 00:17:59,416
When that day comes,

74
00:18:00,166 --> 00:18:01,846
you won't care if I live or die, will you?

75
00:18:06,583 --> 00:18:08,333
You have to survive until that day first.

76
00:18:11,375 --> 00:18:12,375
Stay close to me.

77
00:18:16,041 --> 00:18:17,708
It's not like I have a choice anyway.

78
00:18:25,333 --> 00:18:26,166
Guangqi.

79
00:18:26,333 --> 00:18:27,333
I'm here.

80
00:18:27,708 --> 00:18:29,458
Will the zombie virus research experiments

81
00:18:29,958 --> 00:18:31,666
cause harm to the immune carrier?

82
00:18:32,250 --> 00:18:33,166
I'm sorry.

83
00:18:33,167 --> 00:18:35,416
You do not have permission
to access this information.

84
00:18:43,041 --> 00:18:44,041
A-Leh.

85
00:18:50,875 --> 00:18:51,708
Look.

86
00:18:51,709 --> 00:18:54,208
That wild boar looks
way tastier than a rabbit.

87
00:18:54,750 --> 00:18:56,670
If we catch it, we'll have
enough food for days.

88
00:19:09,041 --> 00:19:10,041
A-Leh, there's a zombie!

89
00:19:15,125 --> 00:19:16,125
Ah!

90
00:19:16,125 --> 00:19:16,750
Hey!

91
00:19:16,751 --> 00:19:18,541
Don't kill me! I'm human!

92
00:19:29,708 --> 00:19:31,348
You weren't bitten by a zombie, were you?

93
00:19:31,916 --> 00:19:32,916
No.

94
00:19:33,041 --> 00:19:36,000
I disguised myself as a
zombie to go hunting.

95
00:19:36,166 --> 00:19:39,333
I've been starving for days without food.

96
00:19:39,750 --> 00:19:41,833
I finally managed to spot a wild boar.

97
00:19:43,041 --> 00:19:45,375
I'm sorry, I thought you were a zombie.

98
00:19:46,791 --> 00:19:48,250
Oh, my friend didn't mean to either.

99
00:19:54,083 --> 00:19:56,000
We need to treat your wound right away.

100
00:19:57,083 --> 00:19:58,165
Do you have a camp?

101
00:19:58,166 --> 00:19:59,166
We'll take you back.

102
00:19:59,333 --> 00:19:59,750
Yes.

103
00:19:59,751 --> 00:20:01,541
My camp is nearby.

104
00:20:01,666 --> 00:20:02,666
Please help me.

105
00:20:08,333 --> 00:20:09,958
This is partly our fault anyway.

106
00:20:10,666 --> 00:20:13,166
We can't just leave him
out here to fend for himself.

107
00:20:16,166 --> 00:20:18,583
Don't worry, it won't take much time.

108
00:20:24,291 --> 00:20:24,916
Thank you.

109
00:20:24,916 --> 00:20:25,916
Ah!

110
00:20:25,916 --> 00:20:26,916
Ouch!
